note: Plain numbers stay numbers, the currency's word works as well as its sign,
note: and a blank cell in a column of amounts is $0.00.
put the text below in file "scores.csv":
    name,score
    Ana,72
    Ben,95.5
    Cy,-3

read the table in "scores.csv" and call it scores.
say the total score of scores.
say the average score of scores.

put the text below in file "tips.csv":
    day,tip
    Monday,$5
    Tuesday,
    Wednesday,$2.50
    Thursday,  

read the table in "tips.csv" and call it tips.
say the total tip of tips.
say the average tip of tips.
say the tips.

put the text below in file "fares.csv":
    city,fare
    Paris,12 euros
    Rome,"1,250.50 euros"
    Oslo,7.5

read the table in "fares.csv" and call it fares.
say the total fare of fares.
